arbor (51.0.0~beta.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Second public beta: cache hits no longer trigger a rescan (the Rescan
    button/Ctrl+R do a true from-disk rescan), and the scan-ingest tail is
    ~3x faster — cold open settles at 1.75 s on a 101k-item fixture
    (Baobab 50.0: 2.25 s on the same benchmark).

